h+="ROOT explicitly allowed inert CodeType construction for the authenticated full Raw4 module and six fixed selected helper AST projections only. RAW4_AND_SIX_PROJECTION_CODE_METADATA_004.json records successful construction and AST/code pairing:85 top functions,7 classes,36 methods,one initializer genexpr. No CodeType was executed, no FunctionType was constructed, and no raw or selected definition/import was invoked. The test module was parsed only, not compiled, collected or run.\n\n"
h+="Raw4 input SHA is "+bindings["raw_sha256"]+". Its independent Source4 peer is retained as inputs/raw004-peer.json; that prior source review grants no approval of these newly authored consumer changes or their runtime. API remains12 required keyword-only fields and seven operating evidence file roles, with global395799/private schema3 361287/legacy345810-395799 caps, exact finite EA9->597->3f74->future-final facts, unchanged externally expected attestation SHA, original incident/terminal twins and historical records. Admission call ASTs and bounded readers are unchanged.\n\n"
h+="This is an isolated source/guard fixture preparation, not final generated release dependency closure, current release acceptance, a whole-site/physical loaded closure, full QA, successful admission, readiness, or native authority. All actual collection/results/healthy module acceptance/current final release and operational binding pins, independent source4 consumer review, and root execution ACK remain None. A different independent complete source/test peer must precede a distinct actual isolated runtime preparation and any operational rebinding. Native003 common and its inherited111-test capture mismatch remain untouched; the separate frozen supplement is copied as an input and is not fixed by this task. Frozen raw005 unit, metadata2, live source, source repositories, production runtime, science/evidence, primary docs and other owners' files remain untouched.\n\n"
